ts per","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"point, so a 1% rollout is buckets ","type":"text"},{"code":"0..<100","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". The same input always","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"produces the same bucket.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The finalizer keeps one ID’s buckets for different flags independent, so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"two flags’ small cohorts overlap at the rate chance predicts. Without it,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the low bits of an FNV-1a hash depend only on the low bits of the input","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"bytes, and one flag’s bucket partly determines another’s.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This is not GrowthBook’s bucketing (different input layout, finalizer,","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"and string encoding), so buckets don’t carry over from GrowthBook.","type":"text"}]},{"name":"Important","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Changing this function re-buckets every user and reshuffles"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every running experiment, so it changes only in a major release."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"important"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://SwiduxFeatureFlags/documentation/SwiduxFeatureFlags":{"abstract":[],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxfeatureflags","title":"SwiduxFeatureFlags","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxFeatureFlags\/documentation\/SwiduxFeatureFlags","role":"collection"},"doc://SwiduxFeatureFlags/documentation/SwiduxFeatureFlags/Bucketing/isInRollout(bucket:rollout:)":{"abstract":[{"text":"Whether ","type":"text"},{"code":"bucket","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" falls inside a ","type":"text"},{"code":"rollout","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" percentage (0–100).","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"sta